        "12/(6 - √11) = 12(6 + √11) / [(6 - √11)(6 + √11)]",
        "The denominator is a difference of two squares: 6^2 - 11 = 25",
        "The numerator is 12(6 + √11) = 72 + 12√11",
        "= (72 + 12√11)/25"
