      "topic_id": "simultaneous_quadratic",
      "prompt": "Solve the simultaneous equations: y = x^2 + 4x + 1 and y = 3x + 13",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Substitute y = 3x + 13 into y = x^2 + 4x + 1: 3x + 13 = x^2 + 4x + 1",
        "Rearrange: x^2 + x - 12 = 0",
        "Factorise: (x - 3)(x + 4) = 0",
        "x = 3 or x = -4",
        "When x = 3, y = 22. When x = -4, y = 1."
